                     <title>Biblia glo., pars iii, cum exposicione Nicholai de Lyra</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Contemporary stamped binding.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">This book was chained in the church (s. xvi,
                        lower half of last printed leaf):</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">'Quibus huiusce opusculi sese assuefacere iuvat
                        Lectura quantum libet/ libere perfruantur Sed tamen eis lege vt
                        Reuerendissimi patris nostri et domini marmaduci Abbatis de Fontibus eius
                        nominis primi Ac Roberti fabri sacre/ theologie professsoris viri sui
                        temporis illustrissimi ac rectoris de vadu/ suis precibus hac luce discedens
                        presentem opusculum huic monasterio legauit/ alter pia consideratione
                        publicum procurans profectum hic catenis obserauit'.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Robert Smythe rector of Wath.</note>
                  </msItem>
